      "description": "윗변 7px 괘선의 영양정보 표 패널.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2 class=\"ds-pt\">영양정보</h2><div class=\"ds-big\"><b>열량</b><span><b class=\"ds-v\">2484</b>kcal / 1737kcal</span><b class=\"ds-pct\">143%</b></div><div class=\"ds-row\"><span>지방</span><b>52.6g</b></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#121212);border:1.5px solid var(--ink,#121212);border-top:7px solid var(--ink,#121212);padding:12px 14px 14px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-pt{margin:0;font-weight:900;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.02em;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:7px solid var(--ink,#121212)}.ds-big{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink,#121212)}.ds-big>span{flex:1;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}.ds-v{font-size:30px;font-weight:900}.ds-pct{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:var(--red,#C3301E)}.ds-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;font-size:15px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Set Row (current, done check)",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "set-row-current",
      "description": "지금 세트: green-tint 행, 스테퍼, 체크 칸, 아래 줄 지난번 비교.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-set\"><b>2</b><div class=\"ds-step\"><button>−</button><b>55</b><i>kg</i><button>+</button></div><button class=\"ds-check\" aria-label=\"완료\"></button><small>지난번 55×6 <b class=\"ds-up\">+2.5kg</b> <b class=\"ds-pr\">PR</b></small></div>",
      "css": ".ds-set{display:grid;grid-template-columns:20px 1fr 56px;gap:4px 8px;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--green-tint,#E6F1EA);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-set>small{grid-column:2/4;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2,#4F5752)}.ds-step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr 30px 56px;height:52px;border:1.5px solid var(--ink,#121212);background:#fff;align-items:center}.ds-step b{text-align:right;font-size:24px;font-weight:900}.ds-step i{font-style:normal;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2,#4F5752)}.ds-step button{background:none;border:0;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer}.ds-check{width:56px;height:52px;border:2px solid var(--ink,#121212);background:#fff;cursor:pointer}.ds-check:hover{background:var(--green-ink,#0B6B4B);border-color:var(--green-ink,#0B6B4B)}.ds-check:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--green-ink,#0B6B4B);outline-offset:2px}.ds-up{font-weight:900;color:var(--green-ink,#0B6B4B)}.ds-pr{background:var(--ink,#121212);color:var(--yellow,#FFD23F);padding:0 6px}"
    },
    {
